OL,3,GNEWSAIrish schools law blocked as
OL,4,Aunionists deploy Stormont veto
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed law on Irish-medium
OL,7,Feducation has been blocked during a
OL,8,Fvote in the Northern Ireland Assembly
OL,9,Fafter unionists deployed a Stormont
OL,10,Fveto.
OL,12,FThe bill, brought forward by Sinn Fein
OL,13,Fassembly member Pat Sheehan, sought to
OL,14,Frequire Stormont's Department of
OL,15,FEducation (DoE) to prepare a workforce
OL,16,Fplan on schools in the sector.
OL,18,FA majority of 43 to 30 assembly members
OL,19,Fbacked the legislation on Tuesday, but
OL,20,Fthe Democratic Unionist Party (DUP) had
OL,21,Ftabled a petition of concern with the
OL,22,Fsupport of other unionists.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
